measurement says the comb is never read over the whole `exitSteps k` run, so each of these
should thread `T`; none of it is verified yet.

`RegenLawGen ∀k` ⟹ (with the already-proven `cascadeReg_topgrind`, which is `∀ marker`) the
doubling phase's TOP RUNG, which is ≈75 % of the phase by step count.
